        "slc_8a60c6306c05fe5f6639ba8b373e6b9354c84f556a79293de840dede767cfb20"
      ],
      "text": "The user model opens with one of the starting questions and drives the conversation with the agent over up to N turns, while the agent reads, edits, and runs against a locally cloned codebase."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_85544aa3b9a575fa8c1e6060fdb73ac5af9e8c68ea8057afb51f8af5c28ee06e",
